Senior Management	Business direction and outcomes	Sprint reviews
Marketing	Customer targeting and segment usefulness	Segment reviews
Retention Team	Inactivity/churn insights	Predictive-model reviews
Operations / Inventory	Resource and demand planning	Operational reviews
